stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Disconnected
  Disconnected --> Scanning: startScan
  Scanning --> DeviceFound: virtual Sleep Band emitted
  DeviceFound --> Connected: connect
  Connected --> AlertAcknowledged: sendAlert eventId
  AlertAcknowledged --> Connected: ALERT_ACK eventId and revision
  Connected --> Connected: repeated eventId returns duplicate ACK without revision increment
  Connected --> Disconnected: disconnect
